  "notes": [
    "Each Draftor and Reviewer turn in a new loop now ends with one short",
    "plain-English paragraph written for the Architect, and the Timeline shows it",
    "on that turn's card. The CLI checks the paragraph's form when the turn is",
    "submitted, refuses a malformed or hidden one before anything is written, and",
    "copies it onto the turn's existing event from the same bytes as the stored",
    "artifact. The Dashboard only displays what the event carries: it never fetches",
    "or writes a summary, and it shows an honest \"unavailable\" line for older turns.",
    "The loop protocol, the artifact templates and `/loop-join` now teach this"
  ],
